{
  // The bundled default operator environment
  // (docs/requirements-session-operator.md §2.2). Image-only and pinned by
  // digest — no Dockerfile, no repo. gurt mounts its own Node runtime into every
  // env (docs/requirements-env-docker.md §3.2), so this image needs no node of
  // its own; it stays on node:26-bookworm-slim because the digest is already
  // verified. Minimal on purpose: it holds an agent CLI (installed lazily, like
  // every session's adapter) and nothing else, because everything it would
  // otherwise need is on the host side of an MCP call.
